  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>GAME RULES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>SNOWMAN</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>SNOWBALL</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>SNOWBALL FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>FREE GAME</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=17>Snowman Symbol substitutes for all symbols.\r\nSnowman Symbol
      appears on reel 1 only during\nBase Games.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=17>Snowball Symbol substitutes for all\nsymbols except Snowman symbol.\r\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<size=21>-   The Snowball Feature is triggered randomly during Base Games.


      -   When triggered, the snowman throws multiple Snowball Symbols to the spinning
      reels.


      -   Snowball Symbols are locked in position and turn into Wilds after reels
      stop.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=21>-   One Snowman Symbol and one or more Snowball Symbols triggers
      Free Games.\n\n-   In Free Games, Snowman Symbol collects Snowball Symbols anywhere
      on reels \n     at the end of every spin.\n\n-   In Free Games, any symbols
      landing beneath the Snowman Symbol will be\n     considered as the Snowman Symbol.\n\n-
      \  There is a progression meter that shows the number of Snowball Symbols required\n
      \    to collect for Snowman Symbol to grow and the current size of Snowman Symbol.\n\n-
      \  By collecting required amount of Snowball Symbols, the Snowman Symbol grows\n
      \    bigger to the next available size in order of 2x2, 3x3, 4x4 and 5x5 and
      every time\n     it grows, additional Free Games are awarded.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
